<title>USA: Comdial to launch less powerful DXP system.</title>
<headline>Comdial to launch less powerful DXP system.</headline>
<byline>Gilles Castonguay</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdial Corp this year plans to expand its line of DXP digital telephone switching systems to meet demand among mid-sized companies, the company's chief executive said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>William Mustain said in an interview that the company in the second quarter of 1997 would introduce a less powerful system that would be more affordable than its current offerings for companies with up to 100 employees.</p>
</text>
